-- Run this ONCE. It is not safe to run twice: it creates tables
-- and types, and the second run will stop on the first one that
-- already exists. That is deliberate — stopping is better than half
-- applying.
--
-- Contains, in order:
--   0035_what_kind_of_job_it_is.sql
--   0036_the_office_can_administer_itself.sql
